        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is a simple 2D platformer adventure game where you play as a duck named Scruffles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains 10 unique levels with increasing difficulty and length (and their own easter eggs).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished Player Movement</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Duck has polished player movement that makes it fun to play whether you have never played a platformer game or if you are an experienced player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash can be played at any pace, whether fast or slow.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains a speedrunning mode so you can see the time it took for you to complete a level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both local leaderboards and global leaderboards, so you can race other Steam users or local times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts are recorded for global leaderboards, so you can see your friends ghosts while racing them.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Xbox Controller Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is fully playable with an Xbox controller.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also, Scruffles is cute)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is a simple 2D platformer adventure game where you play as a duck named Scruffles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains 10 unique levels with increasing difficulty and length (and their own easter eggs).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished Player Movement</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Duck has polished player movement that makes it fun to play whether you have never played a platformer game or if you are an experienced player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash can be played at any pace, whether fast or slow.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains a speedrunning mode so you can see the time it took for you to complete a level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both local leaderboards and global leaderboards, so you can race other Steam users or local times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts are recorded for global leaderboards, so you can see your friends ghosts while racing them.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Xbox Controller Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is fully playable with an Xbox controller.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also, Scruffles is cute)</p>",
        "short_description": "A fun and simple 2D platformer game about a duck named Scruffles. Fight your way through 10 levels with a smooth feeling movement system.",
